  "fashion": {
    "Overview": "Ulzzang fashion complements the cute and youthful makeup with a style that is typically simple, casual, and understated. The look emphasizes a clean and put-together appearance that appears effortless. A common formula is the mixing of proportions, particularly pairing an oversized top with a fitted bottom. Key garments include oversized sweatshirts, hoodies, and t-shirts, which are often partially tucked into skinny jeans or tennis skirts. The color palette is often soft and can include pastels, but the focus is generally on simple, versatile pieces. The fashion avoids overly flashy or complex designs, allowing the \"best face\" to remain the focal point. Accessories are usually minimal,…"
